System configuration:

	Apple Macintosh running MacOS, with the SDL3 + Blend2D graphics
	backend of the icon-sdl fork. This configuration is not part of
	upstream Icon; see README.md.

Latest Icon version:

	Version 9.5.25a of September 7, 2025

Installer:

	icon-sdl fork (github.com/phonologus/icon-sdl)

Missing features:

	Graphics backend is work in progress.

Known bugs:

	None known

Comments:

	Configure with "make SDL-Configure name=macintosh-sdl", then
	"make Icont" as usual. SDL3, Blend2D and AsmJit are built from
	the checksum-pinned sources in deps/; no network access, Homebrew
	or XQuartz is needed. Requires the Xcode Command Line Tools and
	CMake.

